@title Cooling what-if: a fix with fans says the 2D model reads fan gains low
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The first fix of the hot cabinet adds an exhaust fan; its card carries the line about the 3D comparison. The line is small secondary text under the table and does not push the Apply button out of reach.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Cooling what-if"
wait 20
click_text "Try the fixes"
wait_s 120
expect "Devices over limit"
scroll 1100 450 -150
wait 10
expect "about a third low"
shot fan-note
check_layout
